---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="500 — Server Error | OpenVB"
  description="Something went wrong on our end."
>
  <main class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="w-full max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">

      <h1 class="rise font-serif text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink mb-10">
        Server <em class="text-vb-maroon">error.</em>
      </h1>

      <!-- Runtime diagnostic -->
      <div class="rise rise-2 frame text-left mx-auto max-w-lg">
        <div class="frame-header">
          <span class="frame-tab">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-vb-maroon shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            stack trace
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-6 bg-code-bg px-5 py-5 overflow-x-auto">
          <div>
            <span class="text-vb-maroon font-semibold">Unhandled exception.</span>
            <span class="text-ink"> System.Exception:</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-ink-soft pl-4">An unexpected error occurred on the server.</div>
          <div class="text-ink-faint pl-4 mt-2">at Server.HandleRequest(req As Request)</div>
          <div class="text-ink-faint pl-4">at Program.Main()</div>
          <div class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            We've been notified and are working on a fix — much like we work on VB.NET itself.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="frame-status">
          <span class="text-vb-maroon">✕ crashed</span>
          <span class="flex-1"></span>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">team notified</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rise rise-3 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-10">
        <button onclick="window.location.reload()" class="btn-primary cursor-pointer">Try Again</button>
        <a href="/" class="btn-secondary">Go Home</a>
      </div>

      <p class="rise rise-4 font-mono text-[12px] text-ink-faint mt-8">
        Stack trace logged ·
        <a
          href="https://github.com/OpenVBdotnet/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link-plain"
        >report on GitHub</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
